# mcp tools

Usage: meno mcp tools SERVER [TOOL]

Without TOOL: one line per tool, its name and the first line of its description.
With TOOL: the full description and the input schema (JSON Schema) of that tool. Read it
before the first call: the schema names the required arguments and their types.

--json prints the list, or the single tool, as JSON with name, description and inputSchema.
An unknown TOOL fails (exit 1) and names the valid tools.
